&lt;p class="MsoNormal" style="margin: 0in; font-size: medium; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; caret-color: #000000; color: #000000; font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke- text-decoration-line: none; text-decoration-thickness: auto; text-decoration-style: solid;"&gt;Cash is held in the name of the Company.&amp;#160;&amp;#160;The FERC-certified pipeline operations are funded by the Company.&amp;#160;&amp;#160;Any cash excess or deficiency is recorded through equity.&lt;/p&gt;
